  "vibe": "Sky #a8d8ea overhead, kite red #e84855 and sun gold #f2b13c against navy #23364a, with grass #5a9e54 along the bottom. Grandstander rounds every title; Sofia Sans keeps the body plain. The backdrop is a complete outdoor scene, not a texture: two diamond kites bob on their own sine, tethered by navy lines back to the field, tails whipping with bow-ties that flap ±20°; three white clouds cross at different speeds and opacities; a gold sun sits top-right; and eight grass tufts lean along a rolling green hill. Bounce titles overshoot up from 110px below and the whole frame drifts ten pixels either way, as if standing in the same breeze that lifts the kites. Mechanics: a launch checklist that ticks, a bottom-filling line-out meter, pill announcements that pop in at staggered indents, and word rolls. For festivals, family events, camps and parks.",
